Summary of modifications:
- Scoped to macOS and Linux; removed Windows scripts, precompiled helpers, and WSL scanning.
- Removed binary patching, OAuth token extraction, direct Google API calls,
  local proxy injection, host DOM localization, request mutation, and remote update checks.
- Modularized the renderer into domain views with four dedicated topbar popovers,
  isolated Desktop/CLI accounting, and local-only operation.
